      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you not set up 2FA, One Time Code is sent via e-mail instead (for the security).\n\nI'd recommend you to use Authy, which is an app can generate and share the 2FA code on every your devices including PC!\n\nUsing it, you'll be free from a bunch of e-mails and fear of losting your authenticator.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
