  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-09T04:34:47.353Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This is not the same as Two-factor authentication which I have disabled, but a one-time code is requested regardless and it does so very frequently, especially in Unity VRC SDK login. \n\nThis gets really annoying when I have to be copying the code every time I open up an other or new Unity project.\n\nI haven't found any ways to disable this so I assume one-time code request is always enabled.",
